             those files — it shares an idea with them, and share-alike
             attaches to the expression, not to the idea. Recorded explicitly
             so that the reasoning is on the record rather than assumed.
  Stale URL: The URL previously recorded in the manifest,
             https://www.robotics.tu-berlin.de/menue/research/projects/rbo_hand/ ,
             now redirects away; the manifest has been updated to the
             institutional deposit above, which is where the files actually are.

